sequenceDiagram
    participant Customer
    participant MainPage
    participant TeasPage
    participant Cart
    participant System
    participant Order

    Customer->>MainPage: GET /
    MainPage-->>Customer: 200 OK
    Customer->>MainPage: filterByType(type)
    MainPage-->>Customer: filteredTeaCards
    Customer->>MainPage: filterByProfile(profile)
    MainPage-->>Customer: filteredTeaCards
    Customer->>TeasPage: GET /teas
    TeasPage-->>Customer: 200 OK with tea descriptions and prices
    Customer->>Cart: POST /cart/items(teaId)
    Cart-->>Customer: 201 Created
    Customer->>Cart: GET /cart
    Cart-->>Customer: cartItems
    Customer->>System: POST /checkout
    System->>Order: createOrder(cartItems)
    Order-->>System: orderCreated
    System-->>Customer: checkoutConfirmation
